X * EQUILIBRIUM(2) = A2/(A1+A2) * (P1+P2)
X * MOVE 1/5 of way to equilibrium each turn
X * DELTA(1) = (EQUILIBRIUM(1)-P1)/5 = (A1P2-P1A2)/5(A1+A2)
X * DELTA(2) = (EQUILIBRIUM(2)-P2)/5 = (A2P1-P2A1)/5(A1+A2) = -DELTA(1)
